PART TWO Entry in to Ethiopia
\par 
\par 3. Requirements
\par 
\par 1. Any foreigner who wants to enter into Ethiopia shall possess: 
\par (a) a valid travel document; 
\par (b) a valid entry visa or a valid permanent residence permit or an identity card issued by the Ministry if he is covered by Article 14(1) of this Proclamation; and 
\par (c) health certificate, as may be necessary.
\par 
\par 2. A foreigner holding a tourist or transit visa shall, in addition to those specified under Sub-Article (1) of this Article, possess: 
\par (a) a ticket valid for travel from Ethiopia to another country; and 
\par (b) unless otherwise permitted, a valid visa and health certificate which will enable him to enter the country of destination; 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15489249 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\langfenp1033\insrsid15489249 
