\par 
\par 1. The following persons shall be registered by the Authority: 
\par (a) all foreigners residing in Ethiopia; 
\par (b) a foreigner who enters Ethiopia with an immigrant visa, within thirty days of the date of his arrival; 
\par (c) a foreigner who enters Ethiopia with a business or students visa and intends to stay for more than ninety days, within thirty days of the date of his arrival; 
\par (d) without prejudice to Article 14 of this Proclamation, anybody who enters Ethiopia without a visa pursuant to Article 4 of this Proclamation and intends to stay for more than ninety days, within thirty days from the date of his arrival. 
\par 2. The conditions of registration shall be prescribed by Regulation to be issued here under.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7099086 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\langfenp1033\insrsid223008 
