15. Issuance of Residence Permit 
\par 
\par 1. A foreigner who is registered in accordance with Article 13 of this Proclamation shall be required to obtain a temporary or permanent residence permit, as the case may be. 
\par 2. Minor children shall be recorded in the residence permits of their parents. 
\par 3. The conditions of issuance of residence permit shall be prescribed by Regulation to be issued here under.
